Beats me. I don't use wizard mode -- tried it once, and found it boring.

>How do I reverse the effects of the very nasty potion of halucination?  
>I've tried waiting it out, but some pissant halucination distorted 
>something or other usually kills me.

I think praying will work, if you are in good favor with your god. But why 
bother? It's fun to hallucinate -- you get the best messages that way. Just 
be careful about what you attack, and be ready to run.
